{
 "AUTOMATED|This frequency is no longer monitored. This frequency is no longer monitored.": {
  "dur": 5.2,
  "file": "automated_e52c600763.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Eight rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.06,
  "file": "battery_01671b390b.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Four rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.7,
  "file": "battery_fa197285fd.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Six rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.54,
  "file": "battery_fcec00a640.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Ten rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.5,
  "file": "battery_05d06ca6ef.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|...all stations, Bastion-3 has fallen. Bastion-5 is not responding.": {
  "dur": 6.54,
  "file": "command_6223956d9e.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, Command. Fog bank moving up the valley. Expect visibility near zero.": {
  "dur": 6.22,
  "file": "command_6bca788847.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, Command. You now have a one-oh-five battery on call. Q puts a fire mission wherever you are looking.": {
  "dur": 8.655,
  "file": "command_69313163d7.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, airdrop of fuel and ammunition inbound at dawn. Mark your drop zone.": {
  "dur": 6.02,
  "file": "command_65935c0edd.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, relief column delayed. Bridge at Halden is down. Keep the gate shut.": {
  "dur": 7.18,
  "file": "command_ca76ae91fb.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, this is Command. Relief column departs at dawn. Hold for seventy-two hours.": {
  "dur": 7.54,
  "file": "command_67599b0bdc.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7... relief column has been... (static) ...rerouted. Hold position.": {
  "dur": 6.7,
  "file": "command_b157efab05.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Bastion-7, Hammer one-one is on call tonight. Throw a red flare where you want it — that's T — and keep your heads down.": {
  "dur": 6.68,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_240d9b6329.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Bomb impact. Hammer one-one off target, re-arming.": {
  "dur": 3.24,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_dd3e25010d.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Copy red flare. Hammer one-one is in hot — keep your heads down.": {
  "dur": 3.92,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_23b4f47e25.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Good effect on target. That's a lot of them down. Hammer one-one off and climbing.": {
  "dur": 4.72,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_eafa8f7e5a.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Hammer one-one, I have your red smoke. One GBU, danger close. Heads down, Bastion.": {
  "dur": 6.24,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_cb0268eb3f.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Hammer one-one, tally your mark. Two-thousand pounder inbound, ten seconds.": {
  "dur": 5.2,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_4274760056.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Shack. Direct hit on your mark. Hammer one-one off target.": {
  "dur": 3.92,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_cac7a97c07.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|Bastion-7, this is Hollis, Recon Two. Four of us coming in hot down the road — they're right behind us. Cover us!": {
  "dur": 7.947,
  "file": "lt_hollis_332db6f3d7.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|Man down! Keep moving, keep moving!": {
  "dur": 3.042,
  "file": "lt_hollis_eefb9a9900.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|We're through the gate. Thanks for the cover, Bastion. Recon Two will take a spot on the wall.": {
  "dur": 5.627,
  "file": "lt_hollis_e1874e2dd0.ogg"
 },
 "NARRATOR|A column of bloaters walked down the road like a funeral procession. We burst them in the field, one after another, and the valley stank of it for days.": {
  "dur": 10.74,
  "file": "narrator_facbee4b92.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|A herd of brutes came down the flank in a stampede, and the wall shuddered under their weight. It held. Barely.": {
  "dur": 10.14,
  "file": "narrator_ec929eca39.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And then it came — the biggest of them all. It reached our wall, and for a long moment I thought the whole line would come down with it. It didn't. It fell.": {
  "dur": 13.7,
  "file": "narrator_1cafff97fd.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And then it came — the biggest of them all. We threw everything we had left at it, and somehow, out there in the field, it fell.": {
  "dur": 13.358,
  "file": "narrator_4938152ca2.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And then the sun rose on the seventy-second hour. No column came down the road. But we were still there.": {
  "dur": 9.1,
  "file": "narrator_cad02fb33f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Another morning on the wall. Tomorrow they would come again. So would we.": {
  "dur": 5.824,
  "file": "narrator_c83bbc9b2e.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Another night came, as they always did, and the dead came with it.": {
  "dur": 5.66,
  "file": "narrator_6f1664f6d1.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|At dawn the gate was still shut. Whatever we had heard out there in the dark, we never opened it.": {
  "dur": 5.639,
  "file": "narrator_4a226c72c3.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|At dawn, Aran told the sergeant it had been an honour. Kovac told him to save it. One more night.": {
  "dur": 7.371,
  "file": "narrator_891d5d9bc6.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|At dawn, Kovac loaded a fresh belt without a word. Nobody said rerouted out loud again.": {
  "dur": 7.06,
  "file": "narrator_05c7f111d8.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Bastion-7 went quiet that night. The dead came over the wall like water through a broken dam, and the last light on the line went out.": {
  "dur": 10.587,
  "file": "narrator_85dbc12784.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|By dawn there were so few of us left that we stood further apart, so that from the valley, the wall would still look manned.": {
  "dur": 10.86,
  "file": "narrator_dfe6d08385.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|By morning the radio was quiet. Kovac sat beside it for a long time, listening to the static.": {
  "dur": 7.1,
  "file": "narrator_21363998c0.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|By the seventh night, Command had stopped answering. Out on the horizon, the city's fires were going out.": {
  "dur": 7.556,
  "file": "narrator_247ed528aa.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Dawn. We counted the living, then the dead, and then we stopped counting.": {
  "dur": 7.02,
  "file": "narrator_d46968dfe0.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|No one was left to write it down. The gun fell silent before the dawn, and in the morning, the valley belonged to the dead.": {
  "dur": 10.98,
  "file": "narrator_e8f996f5c0.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Not one name was added to the list that night. On that wall, it was as close to a miracle as we ever came.": {
  "dur": 7.86,
  "file": "narrator_e7970c8e4e.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the eighth night, a recorded voice told us that no one was listening anymore. We kept talking anyway.": {
  "dur": 8.34,
  "file": "narrator_d730841fa8.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the fifth night, Bastion-3 fell, and Bastion-5 went silent. We were the last lights left on the line.": {
  "dur": 9.66,
  "file": "narrator_bc4aa25a8f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the first night, the dead came down the valley in their thousands. Bastion-7 answered them with one gun.": {
  "dur": 9.663,
  "file": "narrator_713efb409f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the fourth night, Command promised us an airdrop. The bloaters came down the valley to meet it.": {
  "dur": 8.252,
  "file": "narrator_6d550860f4.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the ninth night, the biggest horde we had ever seen filled the valley from the wall to the ridge. We gave it everything.": {
  "dur": 9.266,
  "file": "narrator_c42d9adddf.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the second night, word came that the bridge at Halden was down. The relief would be late. Only late, we told ourselves.": {
  "dur": 9.62,
  "file": "narrator_f3047a2366.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the sixth night, the radio told us the relief column had been rerouted. Nobody on the wall believed it.": {
  "dur": 6.98,
  "file": "narrator_47dfcf17a5.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Recon Two came down the road with half the valley at their heels. Every one of them made it through the gate.": {
  "dur": 8.36,
  "file": "narrator_54c3cf0e87.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Recon Two died on the road, a few hundred metres from the gate. We watched every moment of it through the sights.": {
  "dur": 9.26,
  "file": "narrator_1cd49f5552.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Recon Two ran the last mile under our guns. Not all of them reached the gate, and the ones who did never spoke of the others.": {
  "dur": 8.468,
  "file": "narrator_3b2bf21e2a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Somewhere past midnight the gun found its rhythm, and the dead went down in rows, like wheat before the scythe.": {
  "dur": 8.38,
  "file": "narrator_3ecb28a090.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Spectre went down that night. We watched it fall burning into the hills, and after that there was no one above us but God.": {
  "dur": 8.62,
  "file": "narrator_197408816c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|That morning the city on the horizon lay dark and still. There was nothing left in it to burn.": {
  "dur": 7.3,
  "file": "narrator_771b142862.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|That morning we understood that there was no line anymore. There was only us.": {
  "dur": 6.477,
  "file": "narrator_4790dd0bca.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The crate came down in the field, and the dead tore it open like a carcass. We watched our supplies scatter in the mud.": {
  "dur": 9.06,
  "file": "narrator_d01ea70395.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The crate came down under a grey canopy, and we held the field around it until the recovery team dragged it home. Ammunition, bottles, and a little hope.": {
  "dur": 10.1,
  "file": "narrator_5f83080b6c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The fourth dawn came up cold and red. The crows had learned where to find us.": {
  "dur": 5.703,
  "file": "narrator_63c05f11bc.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The people from the overpass ran for our lights. None of them reached the gate. Their voices stopped, one by one, out on the open road.": {
  "dur": 10.42,
  "file": "narrator_317cb1c295.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The people from the overpass ran for our lights. Some of them made it inside. The mother would never say the names of the others.": {
  "dur": 7.78,
  "file": "narrator_3c44dba488.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The sun rose again. It did not care who was still alive to see it.": {
  "dur": 5.58,
  "file": "narrator_a263564089.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The tenth night. The seventy-second hour. The last night — if the promises had ever meant anything at all.": {
  "dur": 8.245,
  "file": "narrator_c9e03b902f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The third night began with a woman's voice on the radio, begging for help that we could not give.": {
  "dur": 7.38,
  "file": "narrator_c7bff8018f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The wall base burned all night. The dead walked into the flames screaming, and kept on walking, until they didn't.": {
  "dur": 6.7,
  "file": "narrator_5c7a7c9820.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The wall took a terrible toll that night. By morning there were empty places all along the walkway, and nobody spoke of them.": {
  "dur": 9.476,
  "file": "narrator_0452be70b1.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The woman from the overpass found our lights. She brought every one of those children through the gate alive. For one night, the wall meant something.": {
  "dur": 12.74,
  "file": "narrator_ac7df404cf.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the first giant came down the road, as tall as the wall itself. It fell in the open field, and the whole valley shook when it hit the ground.": {
  "dur": 9.255,
  "file": "narrator_40207f688f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the first giant came. It reached the wall and tore at the concrete with its bare hands, and the bastion shook, until at last we brought it down.": {
  "dur": 11.38,
  "file": "narrator_da926b9893.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the fog rolled up the valley, thick as wet wool, and the dead walked out of it close enough to touch. We fired at shadows.": {
  "dur": 8.925,
  "file": "narrator_6665a5d576.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the generator died, and the lights went out all along the wall. We fought on in the dark, by flare-light and muzzle flash.": {
  "dur": 8.66,
  "file": "narrator_c9e346faff.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|There were no more orders and no more promises. Only the wall, the night, and the gun.": {
  "dur": 8.919,
  "file": "narrator_c6cfd049fb.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We had stopped counting the nights. The dead had not stopped coming.": {
  "dur": 5.58,
  "file": "narrator_1d49d6f50c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We lost good men on the walkway that night. We buried them at first light, beside the others.": {
  "dur": 7.311,
  "file": "narrator_a3fa01a810.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the sun came up, the valley was grey with bodies. Seventy-two hours, Command had said. Sixty-four to go.": {
  "dur": 10.307,
  "file": "narrator_89e2c9e21a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the sun came up, we said it to each other, one by one, all along the line. Bastion-7 is holding.": {
  "dur": 9.007,
  "file": "narrator_89f9b1f427.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the wall was lost, we called the guns down on our own heads. Three of ours died in that fire. The wall held.": {
  "dur": 9.577,
  "file": "narrator_6ea69fdd38.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|I stopped writing their names down.": {
  "dur": 2.529,
  "file": "pvt_aran_9f75de4bcc.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|Sarge, if this is it... it was an honour.": {
  "dur": 3.66,
  "file": "pvt_aran_36b26a8e49.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|Sarge... the city stopped burning.": {
  "dur": 3.18,
  "file": "pvt_aran_9ac2b4e004.ogg"
 },
 "REACH 3-1|Bastion-7, Reach three-one, thirty seconds out with your resupply. Look for the strobe.": {
  "dur": 5.5,
  "file": "reach_3_1_521ecb2870.ogg"
 },
 "REACH 3-1|Load away, load away. Good chute. Reach three-one is clear — good luck down there.": {
  "dur": 6.38,
  "file": "reach_3_1_babe69a46c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Another night. Another dawn.": {
  "dur": 3.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_1b26b08652.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Barrel's cooked!": {
  "dur": 1.462,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_0ac401ff1b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Big group coming down the valley!": {
  "dur": 2.36,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d69d50bbec.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Biggest one yet coming down the valley. Everything we have, tonight.": {
  "dur": 5.12,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_15415c55c3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Bloaters in the mix tonight. Don't let them touch the wall.": {
  "dur": 3.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_185b0b7aa7.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Bloaters! A whole column of them on the road — pop them before they reach the wall!": {
  "dur": 5.502,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_23f61fb001.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Breach! We lost someone!": {
  "dur": 3.442,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_a71307f29f.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Brutes! A whole herd of them — left flank!": {
  "dur": 3.745,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_cfec691662.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Brutes! A whole herd of them — right flank!": {
  "dur": 3.2,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_fa98a6ff96.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Civilians on the road. Hold your fire on them and cover them all the way to the gate!": {
  "dur": 4.44,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_b33ed935dd.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Command hasn't answered since 0300. I'm sure it's the antenna.": {
  "dur": 5.16,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_487efb2421.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Count the survivors. Then count the dead out there. Keep counting.": {
  "dur": 5.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4b650e095b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Crate's down in the field! Keep them off it until the recovery team gets out there!": {
  "dur": 5.28,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_fb8d9de8d1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Danger close! Everything on the wall line — God forgive us.": {
  "dur": 5.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_071b7828bc.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Dawn. Count the living.": {
  "dur": 2.821,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_87c9fb5671.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Engineers found a crate of bottles and a jerrycan in the depot. E throws a Molotov — put it on the wall base and let them burn. And there's a crate of grenades at your feet. G, for anything climbing.": {
  "dur": 13.964,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_9a5d6b7ecf.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Fog's lifting. Back to work.": {
  "dur": 3.128,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d9e75c0ba8.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Friendlies on the road! Kill what's chasing them — and watch your fire!": {
  "dur": 4.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_3259a5215c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Generator's gone! We've lost the lights — pop flares!": {
  "dur": 3.52,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_039c7bfb33.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Got them. Every last one. Somebody find them some blankets.": {
  "dur": 6.64,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_ebf8d1728e.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Gun's too hot!": {
  "dur": 1.72,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_8981f4493c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Here they come — dozens! Hundreds!": {
  "dur": 3.44,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d28aaa65ba.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Horde inbound! Get on them!": {
  "dur": 2.48,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4c36c0c2f3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|If anyone is listening: Bastion-7 is holding. Bastion-7 is holding.": {
  "dur": 6.2,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_9632e1a304.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|It's at the wall! It's tearing the wall apart — kill it!": {
  "dur": 4.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_abd83878a8.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|It's down! The big one is down!": {
  "dur": 2.96,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4603f7ae98.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|It's down. Whatever that was, it's down.": {
  "dur": 4.72,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_130448e432.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Keep it up!": {
  "dur": 1.0,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_0f3cf8545b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Listen. If it all goes wrong, B brings the guns down on our own wall line. It will cost us men. Use it only if the wall is lost.": {
  "dur": 10.72,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_718e1cba09.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Look at them burn!": {
  "dur": 2.16,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_3a364f69fc.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Man down! They got in!": {
  "dur": 3.0,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_e3b10737c3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Movement on the ridge — it's a whole wave!": {
  "dur": 3.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_971743d1d3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|No relief. No orders. Just the night, and the gun.": {
  "dur": 5.233,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d57bbba184.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|None of them made it. Eyes front.": {
  "dur": 2.92,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_b16aaf963e.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Overpass is forty klicks out. There's nothing we can do. Eyes front.": {
  "dur": 4.88,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_7bc282411c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Power's back. Thank God.": {
  "dur": 2.44,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_b87e9706e1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Recon Two is gone. Eyes front.": {
  "dur": 2.96,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_8ea7d6c5a1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Recovery team has the crate! Flares, grenades, and the battery's reloaded.": {
  "dur": 4.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_012fb8622b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Red smoke out! Get your heads down!": {
  "dur": 3.16,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_5ec18c8275.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Rerouted. Sure. Load the belt.": {
