 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|That's not like the other one. That's bigger. Everything we have — put it on that thing!": {
  "dur": 7.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_321e273ef5.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Then we monitor it. Bastion-7 is holding. Say it.": {
